  "body": "Bumps [bootsnap](https://github.com/rails/bootsnap) from 1.26.0 to 1.26.1.\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/rails/bootsnap/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">bootsnap's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>1.26.1</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Fix <code>Bootsnap.enable_frozen_string_literal(app_only: true)</code> raising <code>NameError</code> when the compile cache is disabled.\nApp files are now compiled with frozen string literals on every load, without caching.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Avoid transcoding Ruby source when the Prism workaround runs with a default internal encoding.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Better detect support for fast path scanning. Fix compilation on Illumos.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rails/bootsnap/commit/681429d8efbed10d85168a83c6b5558b6dd667e5\"><code>681429d</code></a> Release 1.26.1</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rails/bootsnap/commit/9298a58c20d40fa49a0f6068a664c0f953e9848d\"><code>9298a58</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/rails/bootsnap/issues/582\">#582</a> from byroot/compiler-no-cache</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rails/bootsnap/commit/e340dd00ded7481789bc5d7a1d193ff88eeccd97\"><code>e340dd0</code></a> Support custom compilers even whith caching disabled</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rails/bootsnap/commit/82b95986d664f283c726492537ecf537977b9f87\"><code>82b9598</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/rails/bootsnap/issues/578\">#578</a> from byroot/windows-binmode</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rails/bootsnap/commit/8ad8d733bdc2f0d09f5539dbab40c9cbe43cf212\"><code>8ad8d73</code></a> Read and write loadpath cache in binmode</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rails/bootsnap/commit/dd767a4ae80592a7cb8595929e5cf76173cb4322\"><code>dd767a4</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/rails/bootsnap/issues/581\">#581</a> from czj/ci-old-rubies-on-ubuntu-24.04</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rails/bootsnap/commit/a53f3dea2d08f483a5cf553beb2bef0382c88300\"><code>a53f3de</code></a> CI: run Ruby &lt; 3.2 on ubuntu-24.04 now that ubuntu-latest is 26.04</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rails/bootsnap/commit/db216d1c90cd58c298e2b537dabf82bae6543c6e\"><code>db216d1</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/rails/bootsnap/issues/576\">#576</a> from pauljccode/fix/source-internal-encoding</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rails/bootsnap/commit/d53eb60e4241e5252d6181d4d86125d4908bde03\"><code>d53eb60</code></a> Declare the UTF-8 regression fixture encoding</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rails/bootsnap/commit/d5cdf8a3a23399de0ffb1271826964cd197811ae\"><code>d5cdf8a</code></a> Preserve source encoding in the Prism workaround</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/rails/bootsnap/compare/v1.26.0...v1.26.1\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility score](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=bootsnap&package-manager=bundler&previous-version=1.26.0&new-version=1.26.1)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't alter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting `@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits that have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all of the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n\n\n</details>",
